<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss money market rates slightly easier.</title>
<headline>Swiss money market rates slightly easier.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss money market rates were slightly easier in Wednesday morning trade, with tomorrow/next money quoted by one bank at roughly 1-1/2 to 1-5/8 percent.</p>
<p>On Tuesday tomorrow/next money was quoted at around 1.81/2.06 percent.</p>
<p>Traders said they saw no signs of any early unusual activity by the Swiss National Bank.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
